  "job_B8.4.3.1_20251003_114835": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6t folc, \u00feis ys se H\u00e6lend witega of Nazareth on Galiglea. \u00dea se H\u00e6lend into \u00feam temple eode he adraf ut ealle \u00fea \u00fee ceapodun innan \u00feam temple & \u00feara & cw\u00e6\u00fe to him, hyt ys awriten, min hus ys gebedhus, witodlice ge worhtun \u00fe\u00e6t to \u00feeofa cote. \u00d0a eodan to him \u00fea blindan and \u00fea healtan & he hi geh\u00e6lde. Witodlice \u00fea \u00f0ara sacerda ealdras & \u00fea boceras gesawun \u00fea wundru \u00fee se H\u00e6lend worhte & & cw\u00e6dun, gehyrst \u00feu hw\u00e6t \u00feas cw\u00e6\u00f0a\u00fe; \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he witodlice, ne r\u00e6ddon ge n\u00e6fre, \u00feu & he forlet hi \u00fea & ferde of \u00fe\u00e6re byrig to Bethania & l\u00e6rde hi \u00fear be Godes rice. On morgen \u00fea he eft to \u00fe\u00e6re byrig for \u00fea hingrede hyne. & he geseh an fictreow wi\u00f0 \u00feone weg; \u00fea eode he to him & ne funde on him buton \u00fea leaf ane; \u00f0a & his leorningcnihtas wundrodon & cw\u00e6don, loca nu hu hr\u00e6dlice \u00fe\u00e6t fictreow forscranc. \u00dea andswarode he him & cw\u00e6\u00f0, So\u00fe ic eow secge gyf ge habba\u00f0 geleafan & ne twynia\u00f0 ne do ge na & ealles \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee ge bidda\u00f0 ge beo\u00f0 ti\u00fea gyf ge gelyfa\u00f0. \u00d0a he com into \u00feam temple \u00fea comon \u00feara sacerda ealdras him to & cw\u00e6don, On hwylcre mihte \u00dea answarode se H\u00e6lend him & cw\u00e6\u00f0, & ic ahsige eow anre spr\u00e6ce; Gyf ge me \u00fea spr\u00e6ce secge",
